-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-foundation_eb elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"foundation_eb\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">GSM Foundation<\/p>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-foundation_h2 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"foundation_h2\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Supporting the Manor for over 45 years<\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-foundation_p0 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"foundation_p0\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Then Board President William J. McAllister called the Foundation an important step toward financial stability and excellent care. Its goals included facility improvements, unbudgeted needs, and a permanent endowment that would take shape in later years.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-foundation_p1 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"foundation_p1\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Today, the Foundation helps bridge a funding gap of more than $20,000 per man each year beyond state support, sustaining the daily care, programs, and services that enrich life at Good Shepherd Manor.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-foundation_imgcol e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"foundation_imgcol\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elemento